# X6-08 / X6-09(T1) / W04 / O01 / O02 / O10 / T1 debug-contract / I03 / I04
#
# The receiver completes one terminal COMMIT, but both verified COMMIT ACKs are
# hidden from the source.  The normal sender then performs its authenticated
# QUERY_EPOCH_STATUS recovery.  A matching same-process COMMITTED result is
# now sufficient for the live source/receiver protocol to complete the handoff.
#
# Expected contract: DRAIN succeeds, the source publishes no COMMIT_UNKNOWN,
# RESET is still too late after the handoff barrier, the original source-side
# waiter remains blocked until source shutdown, and the receiver retains
# exactly one READY/prepared/cache publication without promotion or adoption.

--let $terminal_cas_case= 4
--source suite/preserve_trx_transfer_stby/include/run_terminal_cas_w01.inc
